specs/hal-engine-chat-routes/spec.md:76:- An Express `RequestHandler` is accepted as an `HttpAuthMiddleware` ([validated by: accepts a plain express RequestHandler, which is what a consumer already has](../../src/transport/createApp.test.ts#L75)).
