specs/hal-engine-session-resume/spec.md:34:- A thought still open when suppression begins is committed as the client saw it and left unmarked, and its remaining text opens a new entry marked `suppressed` ([validated by: commits a thought still open when suppression begins as the client saw it, and skips what follows](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L412)).
